From 228ee380bc91b25b11e6c37cefe7848132349df3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunrisepeak <speakshen@163.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:34:48 +0900
Subject: clangd: admit fully verified import-free textual module preambles

Preserve the default textual fallback for module imports while admitting an
ordinary translation unit prefix proven import-free by canonical dependency
scanning. Bind the preamble to current command, generation, environment and
complete filesystem observations, and audit actual PCH reads and imports.

Audit original live compiler file objects before publication. Retry rejected
audits and failed candidate construction once with a zero prefix; keep fresh
prerequisite validation and late completion compatibility checks.
